  "caption": "An explosion shook the Saudi capital Riyadh late Wednesday night following a hostile aerial threat alert 🚨\n\nAccording to an AFP journalist and residents, the blast occurred around midnight after authorities issued a warning that was lifted shortly after.\n\nResidents in the northern and eastern parts of the city confirmed hearing the loud noise to reporters.\n\nThe incident follows just a day after 11 people were wounded in a Houthi claimed attack on the city financial district.\n\nWhat security steps should be taken to protect civilians in the region? 👇\n\nFollow Vok for more stories like this.\n\n#Vok #VokOriginals #SaudiArabia #Riyadh #MiddleEastNews",
